description=Sorted. is a modern, robust, and feature-rich inventory organization mod - a spiritual successor to the abandoned "Better Sorting". \
\
All the features you loved in Better Sorting are now significantly improved, fully automated, and UPDATE-PROOF - no more waiting for compatibility patches after every game update! \
\
CORE FEATURES: \
\
[SORTING] Intelligent automatic categorization with 70+ categories - items are dynamically sorted based on their properties. Alcoholic drinks, Frozen food, Dishes, Cookware, Literature (skill books, recipes, maps, entertainment), Tactical gear, Breathing equipment, Keys, Plushies, Cleaning supplies, detailed clothing categories by body location, and much more. \
\
[SHIFTING] Manual category reassignment - right-click any item to change its category. CHANGES APPLY INSTANTLY - no restart required! You can pick from existing categories OR CREATE YOUR OWN CUSTOM CATEGORY NAME. Your preferences persist across sessions. \
\
[CATEGORY MANAGER] Bulk category management UI - search, select multiple items, and reassign categories all at once. \
\
[MOD SUPPORT] Built-in compatibility with popular mods: AuthenticZ, Filibuster Rhymes, Fluffy Hair, SKAL, Spongie's mods, and more. \
\
COMING SOON: \
[FIRST-RUN WIZARD] When you add a new mod to your playlist, Sorted. will display a convenient modal asking if you want to auto-categorize the new items. Choose from suggested categories or let the mod handle it automatically! \
\
ALPHA TESTERS WANTED - Help us polish this mod before public release! \
\
ALPHA TEST STARTS: January 7th, 2025